{
  "info": {
    "name": "Clan platform - games (TEAM-87)",
    "description": "Run the whole collection in order (Runner). Needs the platform service on {{baseUrl}} with migrations 000001 and 000002 applied. Creates its own developers, so it can be re-run.",
